\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30005247 (OWR-11695854-003). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Mini-Workshop: Quantization of Complex Symplectic Varieties (2022), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2022/45, pp. 2629--2658. Original report and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2022/45}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30005247}

